---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Real Cost of Food"
  description="How Real Cost of Food handles data, cookies, and advertising."
>
  <main class="page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: June 25, 2026</p>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      Real Cost of Food is a static informational website. We do not operate accounts,
      logins, or user profiles, and we do not collect or store any personal information
      you submit — because there is no form or submission mechanism on this site.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We may use third-party analytics (such as Google Analytics) to understand aggregate
      traffic patterns — pages visited, approximate geography, and referring sources.
      This data is collected anonymously and is not linked to you personally. You can
      opt out via your browser's Do Not Track setting or a browser extension such as
      uBlock Origin.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may display ads served by Google AdSense. Google uses cookies to serve
      ads based on your prior visits to this site and other sites on the internet.
      You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's Ad Settings</a>.
      Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's
      prior visits to websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its
      partners to serve ads based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the
      internet.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site itself sets no first-party cookies. Third-party services (Google Analytics,
      Google AdSense) may set their own cookies as described in their respective privacy
      policies. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>Data sources</h2>
    <p>
      All price, nutrition, and sustainability data displayed on this site comes from
      public federal datasets (BLS, USDA FoodData Central) and published academic research.
      No user data is used to generate or personalize this content.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to external sources (BLS, USDA, academic papers). We are not
      responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect
      information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we make material changes to this policy, we will update the date at the top
      of this page.
    </p>

